abstract: "Foundational open-source governance, clinical safety standards, and community templates for the Belgian Society of Paediatric Haematology and Oncology (BSPHO) clinical AI ecosystem (Hacking4Good / Solve with Google x BSPHO 2026) spanning OncoProtocol (UC1), PediDose (UC2), AImesis (UC3), and AutoICF (UC4)."
